{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleSpaceSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleSpaceSemanticToken","symbolKind":"class","title":"MultipleSpaceSemanticToken","modules":[{"name":"Tokens for semantics"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleSpaceSemanticToken"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleSpaceSemanticToken"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["        \/\/ Assuming in Figma with have a space semantic token scaled2xs,","        \/\/ two semantic size tokens will be defined in Figma and generated by tokenator because","        \/\/ its value can vary if compact or regular modes.","        \/\/ They can be declared in protocol SpaceSemanticTokens,","        \/\/ and defined automaticaly in OUDSTheme+SpaceSemanticTokens extension","        @objc open var scaled2xsMobile: SpaceSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._50 }","        @objc open var scaled2xsTablet: SpaceSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._100 }","","        \/\/ Then the develoment team declares an \"higher\" level space semantic token for scaled2xs","        \/\/ inside SpaceMultipleSemanticTokens protocol,","        \/\/ and defined inside OUDSTheme+SpaceMultipleSemanticTokens extension","        var scaled2xs: MultipleSpaceSemanticToken { MultipleSpaceSemanticToken(compact: scaled2xsMobile, regular: scaled2xsTablet) }","","        \/\/ If the same value is used whatever the size class is","        var scaled2xs: MultipleSpaceSemanticToken { MultipleSpaceSemanticToken(scaled2xsTabley) }","","        \/\/ The theme exposes both generated font space semantic tokens and \"crafted\" higher level color semantic tokens.","        \/\/ It is recommended to use the higher level version as it is less error-prone."],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.8.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSpaceSemanticToken","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of ","type":"text"},{"code":"DimensionRawToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" depending to size classes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from Figma inside one object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If a space token exists with its value depending to the size class, it must be packed in such ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSpaceSemanticToken"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplespacesemantictoken"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSpaceSemanticToken\/init(compact:regular:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleSpaceSemanticToken\/compact","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/